#: ../../src/misc.rst:5
msgid "Miscellaneous utilities"
msgstr "杂项工具"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:7
msgid ""
"This section contains miscellaneous functions that don't really belong in"
" any other section."
msgstr "本节包含不宜归入其他任何章节的杂项函数。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:12
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:16
msgid "Buffer data type."
msgstr "缓冲区数据类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:20
msgid "Pointer to the base of the buffer."
msgstr "指向缓冲区基址的指针。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:24
msgid "Total bytes in the buffer."
msgstr "缓冲区中的总字节数。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:27
msgid "On Windows this field is ULONG."
msgstr "在 Windows 上该字段为 ULONG。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:31
msgid ""
"Replacement function for :man:`malloc(3)`. See "
":c:func:`uv_replace_allocator`."
msgstr ":man:`malloc(3)` 的替换函数。参见 :c:func:`uv_replace_allocator`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:36
msgid ""
"Replacement function for :man:`realloc(3)`. See "
":c:func:`uv_replace_allocator`."
msgstr ":man:`realloc(3)` 的替换函数。参见 :c:func:`uv_replace_allocator`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:41
msgid ""
"Replacement function for :man:`calloc(3)`. See "
":c:func:`uv_replace_allocator`."
msgstr ":man:`calloc(3)` 的替换函数。参见 :c:func:`uv_replace_allocator`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:46
msgid ""
"Replacement function for :man:`free(3)`. See "
":c:func:`uv_replace_allocator`."
msgstr ":man:`free(3)` 的替换函数。参见 :c:func:`uv_replace_allocator`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:51
msgid ""
"Callback passed to :c:func:`uv_random`. `status` is non-zero in case of "
"error. The `buf` pointer is the same pointer that was passed to "
":c:func:`uv_random`."
msgstr "传递给 :c:func:`uv_random` 的回调。出错时 `status` 非零。`buf` 指针与传递给 :c:func:`uv_random` 的指针相同。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:57
msgid "Cross platform representation of a file handle."
msgstr "文件句柄的跨平台表示。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:61
msgid "Cross platform representation of a socket handle."
msgstr "套接字句柄的跨平台表示。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:65
msgid ""
"Abstract representation of a file descriptor. On Unix systems this is a "
"`typedef` of `int` and on Windows a `HANDLE`."
msgstr "文件描述符的抽象表示。在 Unix 系统上它是 `int` 的 `typedef`，在 Windows 上是 `HANDLE`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:70
msgid "Cross platform representation of a `pid_t`."
msgstr "`pid_t` 的跨平台表示。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:76
msgid ""
"Y2K38-unsafe data type for storing times with microsecond resolution. "
"Will be replaced with :c:type:`uv_timeval64_t` in libuv v2.0."
msgstr "用于以微秒精度存储时间的非 Y2K38 安全数据类型。将在 libuv v2.0 中被 :c:type:`uv_timeval64_t` 取代。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:88
msgid "Y2K38-safe data type for storing times with microsecond resolution."
msgstr "用于以微秒精度存储时间的 Y2K38 安全数据类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:99
msgid "Y2K38-safe data type for storing times with nanosecond resolution."
msgstr "用于以纳秒精度存储时间的 Y2K38 安全数据类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:110
msgid "Clock source for :c:func:`uv_clock_gettime`."
msgstr ":c:func:`uv_clock_gettime` 的时钟源。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:121
msgid "Data type for resource usage results."
msgstr "资源使用结果的数据类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:144
msgid ""
"Members marked with `(X)` are unsupported on Windows. See "
":man:`getrusage(2)` for supported fields on UNIX-like platforms."
msgstr "标有 `(X)` 的成员在 Windows 上不受支持。类 Unix 平台上受支持的字段请参见 :man:`getrusage(2)`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:147
msgid ""
"The maximum resident set size is reported in kilobytes, the unit most "
"platforms use natively."
msgstr "最大常驻集大小以千字节为单位报告，这是大多数平台原生使用的单位。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:152
msgid "Data type for CPU information."
msgstr "CPU 信息的数据类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:170
msgid "Data type for interface addresses."
msgstr "接口地址的数据类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:190
msgid "Data type for password file information."
msgstr "密码文件信息的数据类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:204
msgid "Data type for group file information."
msgstr "组文件信息的数据类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:216
msgid "Data type for operating system name and version information."
msgstr "操作系统名称与版本信息的数据类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:229
msgid "Data type for environment variable storage."
msgstr "环境变量存储的数据类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:240
msgid "Random data request type."
msgstr "随机数据请求类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:243
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:247
msgid ""
"Used to detect what type of stream should be used with a given file "
"descriptor. Usually this will be used during initialization to guess the "
"type of the stdio streams."
msgstr "用于检测给定的文件描述符应使用何种类型的流。通常在初始化期间用它来猜测 stdio 流的类型。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:251
msgid ""
"For :man:`isatty(3)` equivalent functionality use this function and test "
"for `UV_TTY`."
msgstr "要获得与 :man:`isatty(3)` 等价的功能，可使用此函数并测试结果是否为 `UV_TTY`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:258
msgid ""
"Override the use of the standard library's :man:`malloc(3)`, "
":man:`calloc(3)`, :man:`realloc(3)`, :man:`free(3)`, memory allocation "
"functions."
msgstr "覆盖标准库的 :man:`malloc(3)`、:man:`calloc(3)`、:man:`realloc(3)`、:man:`free(3)` 内存分配函数的使用。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:262
msgid ""
"This function must be called before any other libuv function is called or"
" after all resources have been freed and thus libuv doesn't reference any"
" allocated memory chunk."
msgstr "必须在调用任何其他 libuv 函数之前调用此函数，或者在所有资源均已释放、libuv 不再引用任何已分配内存块之后再调用。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:266
msgid ""
"On success, it returns 0, if any of the function pointers is `NULL` it "
"returns `UV_EINVAL`."
msgstr "成功时返回 0；若任一函数指针为 `NULL`，则返回 `UV_EINVAL`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:269
msgid ""
"There is no protection against changing the allocator multiple times. If "
"the user changes it they are responsible for making sure the allocator is"
" changed while no memory was allocated with the previous allocator, or "
"that they are compatible."
msgstr "没有任何防护机制可以防止多次更换分配器。如果用户更换了分配器，则需自行确保更换时旧分配器尚未分配任何内存，或者新旧分配器相互兼容。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:274
msgid "Allocator must be thread-safe."
msgstr "分配器必须是线程安全的。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:280
msgid ""
"Release any global state that libuv is holding onto. Libuv will normally "
"do so automatically when it is unloaded but it can be instructed to "
"perform cleanup manually."
msgstr "释放 libuv 持有的所有全局状态。通常 libuv 在被卸载时会自动执行这一操作，但也可以指示它手动执行清理。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:284
msgid "Only call :c:func:`uv_library_shutdown` once."
msgstr "只能调用一次 :c:func:`uv_library_shutdown`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:286
msgid ""
"Don't call :c:func:`uv_library_shutdown` when there are still event loops"
" or I/O requests active."
msgstr "当仍有事件循环或 I/O 请求处于活动状态时，不要调用 :c:func:`uv_library_shutdown`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:289
msgid "Don't call libuv functions after calling :c:func:`uv_library_shutdown`."
msgstr "调用 :c:func:`uv_library_shutdown` 之后不要再调用任何 libuv 函数。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:294
msgid "Constructor for :c:type:`uv_buf_t`."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_buf_t` 的构造函数。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:296
msgid ""
"Due to platform differences the user cannot rely on the ordering of the "
"`base` and `len` members of the uv_buf_t struct. The user is responsible "
"for freeing `base` after the uv_buf_t is done. Return struct passed by "
"value."
msgstr "由于平台差异，用户不能依赖 uv_buf_t 结构体中 `base` 和 `len` 成员的排列顺序。uv_buf_t 用完之后，释放 `base` 由用户负责。返回的结构体按值传递。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:300
msgid ""
"It is discouraged to set `len` to a large value as that may result in "
"spurious failures.  Specifically, Windows may fail on writes larger than "
"about 511 MB, and various Unicies may fail on I/O larger than about 2 GB "
"(0x7ffff000 bytes). Instead it is generally better to split the data into"
" multiple `uv_write` calls (attach the `write_cb` to the last one)."
msgstr "不建议将 `len` 设置为较大的值，因为这可能导致偶发的失败。具体而言，Windows 上大于约 511 MB 的写入可能失败，各种类 Unix 系统上大于约 2 GB（0x7ffff000 字节）的 I/O 可能失败。通常更好的做法是将数据拆分为多个 `uv_write` 调用（将 `write_cb` 附加到最后一个调用上）。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:309
msgid ""
"Store the program arguments. Required for getting / setting the process "
"title or the executable path. Libuv may take ownership of the memory that"
" `argv` points to. This function should be called exactly once, at "
"program start-up."
msgstr "保存程序参数。获取 / 设置进程标题或可执行文件路径时必须先调用它。libuv 可能会接管 `argv` 所指向的内存。此函数应在程序启动时恰好调用一次。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:313 ../../src/misc.rst:503 ../../src/misc.rst:704
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: ../../src/misc.rst:322
msgid ""
"Gets the title of the current process. You *must* call `uv_setup_args` "
"before calling this function on Unix and AIX systems. If `uv_setup_args` "
"has not been called on systems that require it, then `UV_ENOBUFS` is "
"returned. If `buffer` is `NULL` or `size` is zero, `UV_EINVAL` is "
"returned. If `size` cannot accommodate the process title and terminating "
"`nul` character, the function returns `UV_ENOBUFS`."
msgstr "获取当前进程的标题。在 Unix 和 AIX 系统上，调用本函数之前 *必须* 先调用 `uv_setup_args`。在需要调用 `uv_setup_args` 的系统上，若未先调用它，则返回 `UV_ENOBUFS`。若 `buffer` 为 `NULL` 或 `size` 为零，则返回 `UV_EINVAL`。若 `size` 无法容纳进程标题和结尾的 `nul` 字符，函数将返回 `UV_ENOBUFS`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:330
msgid ""
"On BSD systems, `uv_setup_args` is needed for getting the initial process"
" title. The process title returned will be an empty string until either "
"`uv_setup_args` or `uv_set_process_title` is called."
msgstr "在 BSD 系统上，需要调用 `uv_setup_args` 才能获取初始进程标题。在调用 `uv_setup_args` 或 `uv_set_process_title` 之前，返回的进程标题将是空字符串。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:334 ../../src/misc.rst:349
msgid "now thread-safe on all supported platforms."
msgstr "现在在所有受支持的平台上都是线程安全的。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:336 ../../src/misc.rst:351
msgid "now returns an error if `uv_setup_args` is needed but hasn't been called."
msgstr "现在若需要调用 `uv_setup_args` 但尚未调用，则返回错误。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:341
msgid ""
"Sets the current process title. You *must* call `uv_setup_args` before "
"calling this function on Unix and AIX systems. If `uv_setup_args` has not"
" been called on systems that require it, then `UV_ENOBUFS` is returned. "
"On platforms with a fixed size buffer for the process title the contents "
"of `title` will be copied to the buffer and truncated if larger than the "
"available space. Other platforms will return `UV_ENOMEM` if they cannot "
"allocate enough space to duplicate the contents of `title`."
msgstr "设置当前进程的标题。在 Unix 和 AIX 系统上，调用本函数之前 *必须* 先调用 `uv_setup_args`。在需要调用 `uv_setup_args` 的系统上，若未先调用它，则返回 `UV_ENOBUFS`。在为进程标题提供固定大小缓冲区的平台上，`title` 的内容将被复制到该缓冲区，若超出可用空间则会被截断。其他平台若无法分配足够的空间来复制 `title` 的内容，则返回 `UV_ENOMEM`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:356
msgid "Gets the resident set size (RSS) for the current process."
msgstr "获取当前进程的常驻集大小（RSS）。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:360
msgid ""
"Gets the current system uptime. Depending on the system full or "
"fractional seconds are returned."
msgstr "获取当前系统的运行时间。取决于系统，返回的是完整秒数或带小数部分的秒数。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:364
msgid "Gets the resource usage measures for the current process."
msgstr "获取当前进程的资源使用度量。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:367
msgid ""
"On Windows not all fields are set, the unsupported fields are filled with"
" zeroes. See :c:type:`uv_rusage_t` for more details."
msgstr "在 Windows 上并非所有字段都会被设置，不受支持的字段以零填充。更多细节参见 :c:type:`uv_rusage_t`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:372
msgid "Gets the resource usage measures for the calling thread."
msgstr "获取调用线程的资源使用度量。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:377
msgid ""
"Not supported on all platforms. May return `UV_ENOTSUP`. On macOS and "
"Windows not all fields are set, the unsupported fields are filled with "
"zeroes. See :c:type:`uv_rusage_t` for more details."
msgstr "并非在所有平台上都受支持，可能返回 `UV_ENOTSUP`。在 macOS 和 Windows 上并非所有字段都会被设置，不受支持的字段以零填充。更多细节参见 :c:type:`uv_rusage_t`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:383
msgid "Returns the current process ID."
msgstr "返回当前进程 ID。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:389
msgid "Returns the parent process ID."
msgstr "返回父进程 ID。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:395
msgid ""
"Returns an estimate of the default amount of parallelism a program should"
" use. Always returns a non-zero value."
msgstr "返回程序应使用的默认并行度的估计值。始终返回非零值。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:398
msgid ""
"On Linux, inspects the calling thread's CPU affinity mask to determine if"
" it has been pinned to specific CPUs."
msgstr "在 Linux 上，检查调用线程的 CPU 亲和性掩码，以确定它是否被绑定到了特定的 CPU。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:401
msgid ""
"On Windows, the available parallelism may be underreported on systems "
"with more than 64 logical CPUs."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，对于逻辑 CPU 超过 64 个的系统，可用并行度可能被低估。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:404
msgid ""
"On other platforms, reports the number of CPUs that the operating system "
"considers to be online."
msgstr "在其他平台上，报告操作系统认为处于在线状态的 CPU 数量。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:411
msgid ""
"Gets information about the CPUs on the system. The `cpu_infos` array will"
" have `count` elements and needs to be freed with "
":c:func:`uv_free_cpu_info`."
msgstr "获取系统中各 CPU 的信息。`cpu_infos` 数组将包含 `count` 个元素，需使用 :c:func:`uv_free_cpu_info` 释放。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:414
msgid ""
"Use :c:func:`uv_available_parallelism` if you need to know how many CPUs "
"are available for threads or child processes."
msgstr "如果需要知道有多少 CPU 可供线程或子进程使用，请使用 :c:func:`uv_available_parallelism`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:419
msgid ""
"Frees the `cpu_infos` array previously allocated with "
":c:func:`uv_cpu_info`."
msgstr "释放先前由 :c:func:`uv_cpu_info` 分配的 `cpu_infos` 数组。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:423
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum size of the mask used for process/thread affinities, "
"or `UV_ENOTSUP` if affinities are not supported on the current platform."
msgstr "返回用于进程/线程亲和性的掩码的最大大小；若当前平台不支持亲和性，则返回 `UV_ENOTSUP`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:430
msgid ""
"Gets address information about the network interfaces on the system. An "
"array of `count` elements is allocated and returned in `addresses`. It "
"must be freed by the user, calling :c:func:`uv_free_interface_addresses`."
msgstr "获取系统上网络接口的地址信息。函数将分配一个包含 `count` 个元素的数组并在 `addresses` 中返回。用户必须调用 :c:func:`uv_free_interface_addresses` 释放它。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:436
msgid ""
"Free an array of :c:type:`uv_interface_address_t` which was returned by "
":c:func:`uv_interface_addresses`."
msgstr "释放 :c:type:`uv_interface_address_t` 数组，该数组由 :c:func:`uv_interface_addresses` 返回。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:441
msgid ""
"Gets the load average. See: "
"`<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Load_(computing)>`_"
msgstr "获取系统负载均值。参见：`<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Load_(computing)>`_"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:444
msgid "Returns [0,0,0] on Windows (i.e., it's not implemented)."
msgstr "在 Windows 上返回 [0,0,0]（即该功能未实现）。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:448
msgid "Convert a string containing an IPv4 addresses to a binary structure."
msgstr "将包含 IPv4 地址的字符串转换为二进制结构。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:452
msgid "Convert a string containing an IPv6 addresses to a binary structure."
msgstr "将包含 IPv6 地址的字符串转换为二进制结构。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:456
msgid "Convert a binary structure containing an IPv4 address to a string."
msgstr "将包含 IPv4 地址的二进制结构转换为字符串。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:460
msgid "Convert a binary structure containing an IPv6 address to a string."
msgstr "将包含 IPv6 地址的二进制结构转换为字符串。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:464
msgid ""
"Convert a binary structure containing an IPv4 address or an IPv6 address "
"to a string."
msgstr "将包含 IPv4 地址或 IPv6 地址的二进制结构转换为字符串。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:469
msgid ""
"Cross-platform IPv6-capable implementation of :man:`inet_ntop(3)` and "
":man:`inet_pton(3)`. On success they return 0. In case of error the "
"target `dst` pointer is unmodified."
msgstr "支持 IPv6 的 :man:`inet_ntop(3)` 和 :man:`inet_pton(3)` 跨平台实现。成功时它们返回 0。出错时目标 `dst` 指针不会被修改。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:475
msgid ""
"Maximum IPv6 interface identifier name length.  Defined as `IFNAMSIZ` on "
"Unix and `IF_NAMESIZE` on Linux and Windows."
msgstr "IPv6 接口标识符名称的最大长度。在 Unix 上定义为 `IFNAMSIZ`，在 Linux 和 Windows 上定义为 `IF_NAMESIZE`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:482
msgid ""
"IPv6-capable implementation of :man:`if_indextoname(3)`. When called, "
"`*size` indicates the length of the `buffer`, which is used to store the "
"result. On success, zero is returned, `buffer` contains the interface "
"name, and `*size` represents the string length of the `buffer`, excluding"
" the NUL terminator byte from `*size`. On error, a negative result is "
"returned. If `buffer` is not large enough to hold the result, "
"`UV_ENOBUFS` is returned, and `*size` represents the necessary size in "
"bytes, including the NUL terminator byte into the `*size`."
msgstr "支持 IPv6 的 :man:`if_indextoname(3)` 实现。调用时，`*size` 指示 `buffer` 的长度，`buffer` 用于存储结果。成功时返回零，`buffer` 中为接口名称，`*size` 表示 `buffer` 的字符串长度，NUL 终止字节不计入 `*size`。出错时返回负值。若 `buffer` 大小不足以容纳结果，则返回 `UV_ENOBUFS`，且 `*size` 表示所需的字节数，NUL 终止字节计入 `*size`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:492
#, python-format
msgid ""
"On Unix, the returned interface name can be used directly as an interface"
" identifier in scoped IPv6 addresses, e.g. `fe80::abc:def1:2345%en0`."
msgstr "在 Unix 上，返回的接口名称可直接用作带作用域的 IPv6 地址中的接口标识符，例如 `fe80::abc:def1:2345%en0`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:496
msgid ""
"On Windows, the returned interface cannot be used as an interface "
"identifier, as Windows uses numerical interface identifiers, e.g. "
"`fe80::abc:def1:2345%5`."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，返回的接口不能用作接口标识符，因为 Windows 使用数字形式的接口标识符，例如 `fe80::abc:def1:2345%5`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:500
msgid ""
"To get an interface identifier in a cross-platform compatible way, use "
"`uv_if_indextoiid()`."
msgstr "要以跨平台兼容的方式获取接口标识符，请使用 `uv_if_indextoiid()`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:515
msgid ""
"Retrieves a network interface identifier suitable for use in an IPv6 "
"scoped address. On Windows, returns the numeric `ifindex` as a string. On"
" all other platforms, `uv_if_indextoname()` is called. The result is "
"written to `buffer`, with `*size` indicating the length of `buffer`. If "
"`buffer` is not large enough to hold the result, then `UV_ENOBUFS` is "
"returned, and `*size` represents the size, including the NUL byte, "
"required to hold the result."
msgstr "获取适合用于 IPv6 作用域地址的网络接口标识符。在 Windows 上，将数字形式的 `ifindex` 以字符串形式返回。在所有其他平台上，则调用 `uv_if_indextoname()`。结果写入 `buffer`，`*size` 指示 `buffer` 的长度。若 `buffer` 大小不足以容纳结果，则返回 `UV_ENOBUFS`，且 `*size` 表示容纳结果所需的大小，包括 NUL 字节。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:523
msgid "See `uv_if_indextoname` for further details."
msgstr "更多细节参见 `uv_if_indextoname`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:529
msgid ""
"Gets the executable path. You *must* call `uv_setup_args` before calling "
"this function."
msgstr "获取可执行文件的路径。调用本函数之前 *必须* 先调用 `uv_setup_args`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:532
msgid ""
"Be careful in setuid executables. On some platforms the executable path "
"is an arbitrary string that is controlled by the user. On other platforms"
" environment variables are consulted that may be under control of the "
"user."
msgstr "在 setuid 可执行文件中要格外小心。在某些平台上，可执行文件路径是可由用户控制的任意字符串；在其他平台上，会查询可能受用户控制的环境变量。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:538
msgid ""
"Gets the current working directory, and stores it in `buffer`. If the "
"current working directory is too large to fit in `buffer`, this function "
"returns `UV_ENOBUFS`, and sets `size` to the required length, including "
"the null terminator."
msgstr "获取当前工作目录，并将其存储在 `buffer` 中。若当前工作目录过长而无法放入 `buffer`，此函数返回 `UV_ENOBUFS`，并将 `size` 设置为所需的长度，包括空终止符。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:545
msgid "On Unix the path no longer ends in a slash."
msgstr "在 Unix 上，路径不再以斜杠结尾。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:547
msgid ""
"the returned length includes the terminating null byte on `UV_ENOBUFS`, "
"and the buffer is null terminated on success."
msgstr "在 `UV_ENOBUFS` 时返回的长度包含结尾的空终止字节，成功时缓冲区会以空字节结尾。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:554
msgid "Changes the current working directory."
msgstr "更改当前工作目录。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:558
msgid ""
"Gets the current user's home directory. On Windows, `uv_os_homedir()` "
"first checks the `USERPROFILE` environment variable using "
"`GetEnvironmentVariableW()`. If `USERPROFILE` is not set, "
"`GetUserProfileDirectoryW()` is called. On all other operating systems, "
"`uv_os_homedir()` first checks the `HOME` environment variable using "
":man:`getenv(3)`. If `HOME` is not set, :man:`getpwuid_r(3)` is called. "
"The user's home directory is stored in `buffer`. When `uv_os_homedir()` "
"is called, `size` indicates the maximum size of `buffer`. On success "
"`size` is set to the string length of `buffer`. On `UV_ENOBUFS` failure "
"`size` is set to the required length for `buffer`, including the null "
"byte."
msgstr "获取当前用户的主目录。在 Windows 上，`uv_os_homedir()` 首先使用 `GetEnvironmentVariableW()` 检查 `USERPROFILE` 环境变量；若 `USERPROFILE` 未设置，则调用 `GetUserProfileDirectoryW()`。在所有其他操作系统上，`uv_os_homedir()` 首先使用 :man:`getenv(3)` 检查 `HOME` 环境变量；若 `HOME` 未设置，则调用 :man:`getpwuid_r(3)`。用户的主目录存储在 `buffer` 中。调用 `uv_os_homedir()` 时，`size` 指示 `buffer` 的最大大小。成功时 `size` 被设置为 `buffer` 的字符串长度；返回 `UV_ENOBUFS` 失败时，`size` 被设置为 `buffer` 所需的长度，包括空终止字节。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:570
msgid "`uv_os_homedir()` is not thread safe."
msgstr "`uv_os_homedir()` 不是线程安全的。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:576
msgid ""
"Gets the temp directory. On Windows, `uv_os_tmpdir()` uses "
"`GetTempPathW()`. On all other operating systems, `uv_os_tmpdir()` uses "
"the first environment variable found in the ordered list `TMPDIR`, `TMP`,"
" `TEMP`, and `TEMPDIR`. If none of these are found, the path `\"/tmp\"` "
"is used, or, on Android, `\"/data/local/tmp\"` is used. The temp "
"directory is stored in `buffer`. When `uv_os_tmpdir()` is called, `size` "
"indicates the maximum size of `buffer`. On success `size` is set to the "
"string length of `buffer` (which does not include the terminating null). "
"On `UV_ENOBUFS` failure `size` is set to the required length for "
"`buffer`, including the null byte."
msgstr "获取临时目录。在 Windows 上，`uv_os_tmpdir()` 使用 `GetTempPathW()`。在所有其他操作系统上，`uv_os_tmpdir()` 使用按顺序排列的 `TMPDIR`、`TMP`、`TEMP` 和 `TEMPDIR` 中第一个找到的环境变量。若这些变量都找不到，则使用路径 `\"/tmp\"`；在 Android 上则使用 `\"/data/local/tmp\"`。临时目录存储在 `buffer` 中。调用 `uv_os_tmpdir()` 时，`size` 指示 `buffer` 的最大大小。成功时 `size` 被设置为 `buffer` 的字符串长度（不含结尾的空终止符）；返回 `UV_ENOBUFS` 失败时，`size` 被设置为 `buffer` 所需的长度，包括空终止字节。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:587
msgid "`uv_os_tmpdir()` is not thread safe."
msgstr "`uv_os_tmpdir()` 不是线程安全的。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:593
msgid ""
"Gets a subset of the password file entry for the current effective uid "
"(not the real uid). The populated data includes the username, euid, gid, "
"shell, and home directory. On non-Windows systems, all data comes from "
":man:`getpwuid_r(3)`. On Windows, uid and gid are set to -1 and have no "
"meaning, and shell is `NULL`. After successfully calling this function, "
"the memory allocated to `pwd` needs to be freed with "
":c:func:`uv_os_free_passwd`."
msgstr "获取当前有效 uid（而非真实 uid）对应的密码文件条目子集。填充的数据包括用户名、euid、gid、shell 和主目录。在非 Windows 系统上，所有数据均来自 :man:`getpwuid_r(3)`。在 Windows 上，uid 和 gid 被设置为 -1，没有实际意义，shell 为 `NULL`。成功调用此函数后，分配给 `pwd` 的内存需使用 :c:func:`uv_os_free_passwd` 释放。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:605
msgid ""
"Gets a subset of the password file entry for the provided uid. The "
"populated data includes the username, euid, gid, shell, and home "
"directory. On non-Windows systems, all data comes from "
":man:`getpwuid_r(3)`. On Windows, uid and gid are set to -1 and have no "
"meaning, and shell is `NULL`. After successfully calling this function, "
"the memory allocated to `pwd` needs to be freed with "
":c:func:`uv_os_free_passwd`."
msgstr "获取所提供 uid 对应的密码文件条目子集。填充的数据包括用户名、euid、gid、shell 和主目录。在非 Windows 系统上，所有数据均来自 :man:`getpwuid_r(3)`。在 Windows 上，uid 和 gid 被设置为 -1，没有实际意义，shell 为 `NULL`。成功调用此函数后，分配给 `pwd` 的内存需使用 :c:func:`uv_os_free_passwd` 释放。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:617
msgid ""
"Gets a subset of the group file entry for the provided uid. The populated"
" data includes the group name, gid, and members. On non-Windows systems, "
"all data comes from :man:`getgrgid_r(3)`. On Windows, uid and gid are set"
" to -1 and have no meaning. After successfully calling this function, the"
" memory allocated to `group` needs to be freed with "
":c:func:`uv_os_free_group`."
msgstr "获取所提供 uid 对应的组文件条目子集。填充的数据包括组名、gid 和成员。在非 Windows 系统上，所有数据均来自 :man:`getgrgid_r(3)`。在 Windows 上，uid 和 gid 被设置为 -1，没有实际意义。成功调用此函数后，分配给 `group` 的内存需使用 :c:func:`uv_os_free_group` 释放。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:628
msgid "Frees the memory previously allocated with :c:func:`uv_os_get_group`."
msgstr "释放先前由 :c:func:`uv_os_get_group` 分配的内存。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:634
msgid ""
"Frees the `pwd` memory previously allocated with "
":c:func:`uv_os_get_passwd`."
msgstr "释放先前由 :c:func:`uv_os_get_passwd` 分配的 `pwd` 内存。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:640
msgid ""
"Gets the amount of free memory available in the system, as reported by "
"the kernel (in bytes). Returns 0 when unknown."
msgstr "获取系统中可用的空闲内存量，由内核报告（以字节为单位）。未知时返回 0。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:645
msgid ""
"Gets the total amount of physical memory in the system (in bytes). "
"Returns 0 when unknown."
msgstr "获取系统中物理内存的总量（以字节为单位）。未知时返回 0。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:650
msgid ""
"Gets the total amount of memory available to the process (in bytes) based"
" on limits imposed by the OS. If there is no such constraint, or the "
"constraint is unknown, `0` is returned. If there is a constraining "
"mechanism, but there is no constraint set, `UINT64_MAX` is returned. Note"
" that it is not unusual for this value to be less than or greater than "
":c:func:`uv_get_total_memory`."
msgstr "基于操作系统施加的限制，获取进程可用的内存总量（以字节为单位）。若不存在此类约束或约束未知，则返回 `0`。若存在约束机制但未设置约束，则返回 `UINT64_MAX`。注意，该值小于或大于 :c:func:`uv_get_total_memory` 的情况并不罕见。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:657
msgid ""
"This function currently only returns a non-zero value on Linux, based on "
"cgroups if it is present, and on z/OS based on RLIMIT_MEMLIMIT."
msgstr "此函数目前仅在 Linux 上返回非零值（若存在 cgroups，则基于 cgroups），在 z/OS 上则基于 RLIMIT_MEMLIMIT。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:664
msgid ""
"Gets the amount of free memory that is still available to the process (in"
" bytes). This differs from :c:func:`uv_get_free_memory` in that it takes "
"into account any limits imposed by the OS. If there is no such "
"constraint, or the constraint is unknown, the amount returned will be "
"identical to :c:func:`uv_get_free_memory`."
msgstr "获取进程仍可使用的空闲内存量（以字节为单位）。它与 :c:func:`uv_get_free_memory` 的不同之处在于，它会将操作系统施加的所有限制考虑在内。若不存在此类约束或约束未知，则返回的内存量与 :c:func:`uv_get_free_memory` 相同。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:670
msgid ""
"This function currently only returns a value that is different from what "
":c:func:`uv_get_free_memory` reports on Linux, based on cgroups if it is "
"present."
msgstr "此函数目前仅在 Linux 上（若存在 cgroups，则基于 cgroups）返回与 :c:func:`uv_get_free_memory` 所报告的值不同的值。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:678
msgid ""
"Returns the current high-resolution timestamp. This is expressed in "
"nanoseconds. It is relative to an arbitrary time in the past. It is not "
"related to the time of day and therefore not subject to clock drift. The "
"primary use is for measuring performance between intervals."
msgstr "返回当前的高分辨率时间戳。以纳秒表示。它相对于过去某个任意时刻，与一天中的时刻无关，因此不受时钟漂移的影响。其主要用途是测量时间间隔之间的性能。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:684
msgid ""
"Not every platform can support nanosecond resolution; however, this value"
" will always be in nanoseconds."
msgstr "并非每个平台都能支持纳秒级分辨率，但该值始终以纳秒为单位。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:689
msgid ""
"Obtain the current system time from a high-resolution real-time or "
"monotonic clock source."
msgstr "从高分辨率的实时或单调时钟源获取当前系统时间。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:692
msgid ""
"The real-time clock counts from the UNIX epoch (1970-01-01) and is "
"subject to time adjustments; it can jump back in time."
msgstr "实时时钟从 UNIX 纪元（1970-01-01）开始计数，会受时间调整的影响，可能出现时间回跳。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:695
msgid ""
"The monotonic clock counts from an arbitrary point in the past and never "
"jumps back in time."
msgstr "单调时钟从过去某个任意时刻开始计数，绝不会出现时间回跳。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:702
msgid "Prints all handles associated with the given `loop` to the given `stream`."
msgstr "将与给定 `loop` 关联的所有句柄打印到给定的 `stream`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:715
msgid "The format is `[flags] handle-type handle-address`. For `flags`:"
msgstr "格式为 `[flags] handle-type handle-address`。对于 `flags`："

#: ../../src/misc.rst:717
msgid "`R` is printed for a handle that is referenced"
msgstr "对于被引用的句柄，会打印 `R`"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:718
msgid "`A` is printed for a handle that is active"
msgstr "对于处于活动状态的句柄，会打印 `A`"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:719
msgid "`I` is printed for a handle that is internal"
msgstr "对于内部句柄，会打印 `I`"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:722 ../../src/misc.rst:733
msgid ""
"This function is meant for ad hoc debugging, there is no API/ABI "
"stability guarantees."
msgstr "此函数仅用于临时调试，不提供 API/ABI 稳定性保证。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:729
msgid ""
"This is the same as :c:func:`uv_print_all_handles` except only active "
"handles are printed."
msgstr "与 :c:func:`uv_print_all_handles` 相同，但只打印处于活动状态的句柄。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:740
msgid ""
"Retrieves all environment variables. This function will allocate memory "
"which must be freed by calling :c:func:`uv_os_free_environ`."
msgstr "获取所有环境变量。此函数会分配内存，必须调用 :c:func:`uv_os_free_environ` 释放。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:744 ../../src/misc.rst:766 ../../src/misc.rst:776
#: ../../src/misc.rst:786
msgid "This function is not thread safe."
msgstr "此函数不是线程安全的。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:750
msgid ""
"Frees the memory allocated for the environment variables by "
":c:func:`uv_os_environ`."
msgstr "释放由 :c:func:`uv_os_environ` 为环境变量分配的内存。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:757
msgid ""
"Retrieves the environment variable specified by `name`, copies its value "
"into `buffer`, and sets `size` to the string length of the value. When "
"calling this function, `size` must be set to the amount of storage "
"available in `buffer`, including the null terminator. If the environment "
"variable exceeds the storage available in `buffer`, `UV_ENOBUFS` is "
"returned, and `size` is set to the amount of storage required to hold the"
" value. If no matching environment variable exists, `UV_ENOENT` is "
"returned."
msgstr "获取 `name` 指定的环境变量，将其值复制到 `buffer` 中，并将 `size` 设置为该值的字符串长度。调用此函数时，必须将 `size` 设置为 `buffer` 中可用的存储量，包括空终止符。若环境变量的值超出 `buffer` 的可用存储空间，则返回 `UV_ENOBUFS`，并将 `size` 设置为容纳该值所需的存储量。若不存在匹配的环境变量，则返回 `UV_ENOENT`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:772
msgid ""
"Creates or updates the environment variable specified by `name` with "
"`value`."
msgstr "将 `name` 指定的环境变量创建或更新为 `value`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:782
msgid ""
"Deletes the environment variable specified by `name`. If no such "
"environment variable exists, this function returns successfully."
msgstr "删除 `name` 指定的环境变量。若该环境变量不存在，此函数也成功返回。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:792
msgid ""
"Returns the hostname as a null-terminated string in `buffer`, and sets "
"`size` to the string length of the hostname. When calling this function, "
"`size` must be set to the amount of storage available in `buffer`, "
"including the null terminator. If the hostname exceeds the storage "
"available in `buffer`, `UV_ENOBUFS` is returned, and `size` is set to the"
" amount of storage required to hold the value."
msgstr "在 `buffer` 中以空字符结尾的字符串形式返回主机名，并将 `size` 设置为主机名的字符串长度。调用此函数时，必须将 `size` 设置为 `buffer` 中可用的存储量，包括空终止符。若主机名超出 `buffer` 的可用存储空间，则返回 `UV_ENOBUFS`，并将 `size` 设置为容纳该值所需的存储量。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:801
msgid ""
"`UV_MAXHOSTNAMESIZE` is available and represents the maximum `buffer` "
"size required to store a hostname and terminating `nul` character."
msgstr "`UV_MAXHOSTNAMESIZE` 可用，表示 `buffer` 为存储主机名和结尾 `nul` 字符所需的最大大小。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:807
msgid ""
"Retrieves the scheduling priority of the process specified by `pid`. The "
"returned value of `priority` is between -20 (high priority) and 19 (low "
"priority)."
msgstr "获取 `pid` 指定进程的调度优先级。返回的 `priority` 值介于 -20（高优先级）与 19（低优先级）之间。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:812
msgid ""
"On Windows, the returned priority will equal one of the `UV_PRIORITY` "
"constants."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，返回的优先级将等于 `UV_PRIORITY` 常量之一。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:819
msgid ""
"Sets the scheduling priority of the process specified by `pid`. The "
"`priority` value range is between -20 (high priority) and 19 (low "
"priority). The constants `UV_PRIORITY_LOW`, `UV_PRIORITY_BELOW_NORMAL`, "
"`UV_PRIORITY_NORMAL`, `UV_PRIORITY_ABOVE_NORMAL`, `UV_PRIORITY_HIGH`, and"
" `UV_PRIORITY_HIGHEST` are also provided for convenience."
msgstr "设置 `pid` 指定进程的调度优先级。`priority` 的取值范围介于 -20（高优先级）与 19（低优先级）之间。为方便起见，还提供了常量 `UV_PRIORITY_LOW`、`UV_PRIORITY_BELOW_NORMAL`、`UV_PRIORITY_NORMAL`、`UV_PRIORITY_ABOVE_NORMAL`、`UV_PRIORITY_HIGH` 和 `UV_PRIORITY_HIGHEST`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:826
msgid ""
"On Windows, this function utilizes `SetPriorityClass()`. The `priority` "
"argument is mapped to a Windows priority class. When retrieving the "
"process priority, the result will equal one of the `UV_PRIORITY` "
"constants, and not necessarily the exact value of `priority`."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，此函数使用 `SetPriorityClass()`。`priority` 参数会被映射到某个 Windows 优先级类。检索进程优先级时，结果将等于 `UV_PRIORITY` 常量之一，而不一定是 `priority` 的精确值。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:832
msgid ""
"On Windows, setting `PRIORITY_HIGHEST` will only work for elevated user, "
"for others it will be silently reduced to `PRIORITY_HIGH`."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，设置 `PRIORITY_HIGHEST` 仅对已提权的用户有效，对其他用户会被静默降低为 `PRIORITY_HIGH`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:836
msgid ""
"On IBM i PASE, the highest process priority is -10. The constant "
"`UV_PRIORITY_HIGHEST` is -10, `UV_PRIORITY_HIGH` is -7, "
"`UV_PRIORITY_ABOVE_NORMAL` is -4, `UV_PRIORITY_NORMAL` is 0, "
"`UV_PRIORITY_BELOW_NORMAL` is 15 and `UV_PRIORITY_LOW` is 39."
msgstr "在 IBM i PASE 上，最高的进程优先级为 -10。常量 `UV_PRIORITY_HIGHEST` 为 -10，`UV_PRIORITY_HIGH` 为 -7，`UV_PRIORITY_ABOVE_NORMAL` 为 -4，`UV_PRIORITY_NORMAL` 为 0，`UV_PRIORITY_BELOW_NORMAL` 为 15，`UV_PRIORITY_LOW` 为 39。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:842
msgid ""
"On IBM i PASE, you are not allowed to change your priority unless you "
"have the \\*JOBCTL special authority (even to lower it)."
msgstr "在 IBM i PASE 上，除非拥有 \\*JOBCTL 特殊权限，否则不允许更改自身的优先级（即使调低优先级也不允许）。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:849
msgid ""
"Retrieves system information in `buffer`. The populated data includes the"
" operating system name, release, version, and machine. On non-Windows "
"systems, `uv_os_uname()` is a thin wrapper around :man:`uname(2)`. "
"Returns zero on success, and a non-zero error value otherwise."
msgstr "在 `buffer` 中获取系统信息。填充的数据包括操作系统名称、发行版、版本号和机器类型。在非 Windows 系统上，`uv_os_uname()` 是 :man:`uname(2)` 的一个轻量封装。成功时返回零，否则返回非零错误值。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:858
msgid ""
"Cross-platform implementation of :man:`gettimeofday(2)`. The timezone "
"argument to `gettimeofday()` is not supported, as it is considered "
"obsolete."
msgstr ":man:`gettimeofday(2)` 的跨平台实现。`gettimeofday()` 的时区参数不受支持，因为该参数已被视为过时。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:865
msgid ""
"Fill `buf` with exactly `buflen` cryptographically strong random bytes "
"acquired from the system CSPRNG. `flags` is reserved for future extension"
" and must currently be 0."
msgstr "用从系统 CSPRNG 获取的恰好 `buflen` 个密码学安全的随机字节填充 `buf`。`flags` 保留用于未来扩展，当前必须为 0。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:869
msgid ""
"Short reads are not possible. When less than `buflen` random bytes are "
"available, a non-zero error value is returned or passed to the callback."
msgstr "不可能出现短读。当可用的随机字节少于 `buflen` 时，将返回非零错误值，或将其传递给回调。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:872
msgid ""
"The synchronous version may block indefinitely when not enough entropy is"
" available. The asynchronous version may not ever finish when the system "
"is low on entropy."
msgstr "当可用熵不足时，同步版本可能无限期阻塞；当系统熵不足时，异步版本可能永远无法完成。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:876
msgid "Sources of entropy:"
msgstr "熵来源："

#: ../../src/misc.rst:878
msgid ""
"Windows: `RtlGenRandom <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/desktop/api/ntsecapi/nf-ntsecapi-rtlgenrandom>_`."
msgstr "Windows：`RtlGenRandom <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/desktop/api/ntsecapi/nf-ntsecapi-rtlgenrandom>_`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:879
msgid ""
"Linux, Android: :man:`getrandom(2)` if available, or :man:`urandom(4)` "
"after reading from `/dev/random` once, or the `KERN_RANDOM` "
":man:`sysctl(2)`."
msgstr "Linux、Android：若可用则使用 :man:`getrandom(2)`，或在从 `/dev/random` 读取一次后使用 :man:`urandom(4)`，或使用 `KERN_RANDOM` :man:`sysctl(2)`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:882
msgid ""
"FreeBSD: `getrandom(2) "
"<https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=getrandom&sektion=2>_`, or "
"`/dev/urandom` after reading from `/dev/random` once."
msgstr "FreeBSD：`getrandom(2) <https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=getrandom&sektion=2>_`，或在从 `/dev/random` 读取一次后使用 `/dev/urandom`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:884
msgid "NetBSD: `KERN_ARND` `sysctl(7) <https://man.netbsd.org/sysctl.7>_`"
msgstr "NetBSD：`KERN_ARND` `sysctl(7) <https://man.netbsd.org/sysctl.7>_`"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:885
msgid ""
"macOS, OpenBSD: `getentropy(2) <https://man.openbsd.org/getentropy.2>_` "
"if available, or `/dev/urandom` after reading from `/dev/random` once."
msgstr "macOS、OpenBSD：若可用则使用 `getentropy(2) <https://man.openbsd.org/getentropy.2>_`，或在从 `/dev/random` 读取一次后使用 `/dev/urandom`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:887
msgid "AIX: `/dev/random`."
msgstr "AIX：`/dev/random`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:888
msgid "IBM i: `/dev/urandom`."
msgstr "IBM i：`/dev/urandom`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:889
msgid "Other UNIX: `/dev/urandom` after reading from `/dev/random` once."
msgstr "其他 UNIX：在从 `/dev/random` 读取一次后使用 `/dev/urandom`。"

