msgstr "使用同步版本时，`loop` 和 `req` 两个参数均不使用，可设置为 `NULL`。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:902
msgid "Causes the calling thread to sleep for `msec` milliseconds."
msgstr "使调用线程休眠 `msec` 毫秒。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:917
msgid "String manipulation functions"
msgstr "字符串操作函数"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:919
msgid ""
"These string utilities are needed internally for dealing with Windows, "
"and are exported to allow clients to work uniformly with this data when "
"the libuv API is not complete."
msgstr "这些字符串工具是 libuv 内部处理 Windows 时所需的；将其导出是为了让客户端在 libuv API 不完整时也能统一处理这类数据。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:925
msgid ""
"Get the length of a UTF-16 (or UCS-2) `utf16` value after converting it "
"to WTF-8. If `utf16` is NUL terminated, `utf16_len` can be set to -1, "
"otherwise it must be specified."
msgstr "获取 UTF-16（或 UCS-2）值 `utf16` 转换为 WTF-8 之后的长度。若 `utf16` 以 NUL 结尾，`utf16_len` 可设置为 -1，否则必须指定该值。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:933
msgid ""
"Convert UTF-16 (or UCS-2) data in `utf16` to WTF-8 data in `*wtf8_ptr`. "
"The `utf16_len` count (in characters) gives the length of `utf16`. If "
"`utf16` is NUL terminated, `utf16_len` can be set to -1, otherwise it "
"must be specified. If `wtf8_ptr` is `NULL`, no result will be computed, "
"but the length (equal to `uv_utf16_length_as_wtf8`) will be stored in "
"`wtf8_len_ptr`. If `*wtf8_ptr` is `NULL`, space for the conversion will "
"be allocated and returned in `wtf8_ptr` and the length will be returned "
"in `wtf8_len_ptr`. Otherwise, the length of `*wtf8_ptr` must be passed in"
" `wtf8_len_ptr`. The `wtf8_ptr` must contain an extra space for an extra "
"NUL after the result. If the result is truncated, `UV_ENOBUFS` will be "
"returned and `wtf8_len_ptr` will be the length of the required `wtf8_ptr`"
" to contain the whole result."
msgstr "将 `utf16` 中的 UTF-16（或 UCS-2）数据转换为 `*wtf8_ptr` 中的 WTF-8 数据。`utf16_len` 的计数值（以字符为单位）给出 `utf16` 的长度。若 `utf16` 以 NUL 结尾，`utf16_len` 可设置为 -1，否则必须指定该值。若 `wtf8_ptr` 为 `NULL`，则不会计算结果，但会将长度（等于 `uv_utf16_length_as_wtf8`）存储在 `wtf8_len_ptr` 中。若 `*wtf8_ptr` 为 `NULL`，则会为转换分配空间并在 `wtf8_ptr` 中返回，长度在 `wtf8_len_ptr` 中返回。否则，`*wtf8_ptr` 的长度必须在 `wtf8_len_ptr` 中传入。`wtf8_ptr` 必须包含额外的空间，用于在结果之后存放一个额外的 NUL。若结果被截断，将返回 `UV_ENOBUFS`，且 `wtf8_len_ptr` 将是容纳完整结果所需的 `wtf8_ptr` 长度。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:950
msgid ""
"Get the length in characters of a NUL-terminated WTF-8 `wtf8` value after"
" converting it to UTF-16 (or UCS-2), including NUL terminator."
msgstr "获取以 NUL 结尾的 WTF-8 值 `wtf8` 转换为 UTF-16（或 UCS-2）之后的字符长度，包括空终止符。"

#: ../../src/misc.rst:957
msgid ""
"Convert NUL-terminated WTF-8 data in `wtf8` to UTF-16 (or UCS-2) data in "
"`utf16`. The `utf16_len` count (in characters) must include space for the"
" NUL terminator."
msgstr "将 `wtf8` 中以 NUL 结尾的 WTF-8 数据转换为 `utf16` 中的 UTF-16（或 UCS-2）数据。`utf16_len` 的计数值（以字符为单位）必须包含空终止符所需的空间。"

